bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    pixel_surface_producer_frames_refused_no_theme_stamp_2026-11-26, 0, "Root cause: HostCompositor frame admission requires frame.theme_id == active content theme for every origin; pixel_surface_content_frame left theme_id empty (the GUI producer had the same defect, fixed in 69166cadc70). Probe on release/1.0.0 f2f5776b73f: producer frame refused, same frame with theme set accepted. Fix: required explicit theme parameter, callers resolve active-or-default; gate unchanged. Evidence (seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b sha256 fb80903917d6d5f5): host_content_frame_admission_spec 0/1 -> 1/1, wm_damage_present_skip 3/4 -> 4/4, wm_multi_window_scenarios 1/4 -> 4/4, wm_focus_zorder 2/4 -> 4/4, wm_window_lifecycle 1/5 -> 4/5, simpleos_wm_behavior_evidence 2/6 -> 4/6. Remaining reds in those files have other causes and are not covered by this fix."

